	"title"		"Local Multi-Control — Solo Multiplayer, 2–12 Characters | 本地多角色"
	"description"		"[h1]Local Multi-Control (DualRoleAdventure)[/h1]
Play Slay the Spire 2's official multiplayer entirely by yourself: control 2–12 characters on one machine, switching between them freely. No network and no second player — the real multiplayer rules run underneath, so decks, energy, gold, potions, relics, and choices all stay separate per character.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]2–12 local characters (duplicates allowed): Multiplayer → Host → Local Multi-Control
[*]Switch characters anytime with Tab / Shift+Tab
[*]Full run flow: combat, per-character rewards, events, shops, rest sites, treasure, bosses, save & continue
[*]Vakuu AI auto-play — hand any character (or the whole team) to the built-in autopilot
[*]Optional 'ghost hands' overlay (F8): see your other characters' hands above your own, reposition with Ctrl+Arrows
[*]Pure code mod, no asset pack; also works with Custom mode (seeds & modifiers)
[/list]

[h2]Heritage[/h2]
Created by 磁石战士Ω (liwenhao0427), who designed and built everything up to v1.30 before discontinuing in June 2026. This version (v1.31+) is maintained by the community as an independent continuation — currently updated for game v0.111.0. Original item: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747538947

[h2]Feedback & source[/h2]
https://github.com/nanthepsmith-droid/STS2_DualRoleAdventure — report bugs via GitHub Issues with your act, screen, steps, and the log from %APPDATA%/SlayTheSpire2/logs/godot.log

[h2]中文简介[/h2]
单人操控 2–12 名角色的本地多控 Mod。进入方式：多人模式 → 创建 → 单人多角色；Tab 切换角色，F8 显示队友手牌。本条目为社区接续维护版本（原版条目见上方链接）；反馈请到 GitHub Issues。"
	"changenote"		"v1.38: bugfix release — removed the delay before the post-combat reward screen, fixed the missing End Turn button after a character dies, fixed the event card-reward softlock when the reward owner differs from the controlled character, and fixed the Vakuu settings panel showing blank on first open."
